# Crash-recovery artefacts from a benchmark run in progress. Everything else
# under evals/results is tracked on purpose: those files are the evidence for
# the numbers in the README, and a claim whose source is gitignored cannot be
# checked by anyone reading the repository.
evals/results/*-partial.json
